---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Payment received" description="PayPal confirms the payment. The shop then marks the item pending." path="/order/thanks">
  <div class="wrap section">
    <h1>If PayPal accepted the payment, the order is in.</h1>
    <p>The item price and the shipping rate on the previous page are what PayPal charged. The shop computer marks the item pending and opens a packing order. The eBay listing is not ended from this site.</p>
    <p><a href="/ebay">Back to electronics</a></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
